OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'took cover' during bow
OL,4,Aand arrow incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a village near
OL,7,FHuddersfield have described how they
OL,8,Ftook cover as a bow and arrow was fired
OL,9,Fat cars on a busy street.
OL,11,FPolice were called to reports of a man
OL,12,Fbehaving erratically and driving
OL,13,Fdangerously on Huddersfield Road in
OL,14,FSkelmanthorpe, at about 17:30 BST on
OL,15,FTuesday, before he left the vehicle and
OL,16,Faimed the weapon at passing cars.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
