OL,3,GNEWSAResidents 'took cover' during bow
OL,4,Aand arrow incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FMembers of the public tackled the man
OL,7,Fto the ground before police arrived. A
OL,8,F68-year-old man was arrested on
OL,9,Fsuspicion of possessing an offensive
OL,10,Fweapon in a public place, and has since
OL,11,Fbeen detained under the Mental Health
OL,12,FAct.
OL,14,FHarjinder Singh, of chip shop Groves
OL,15,FFisheries, said people were "very
OL,16,Fscared" during the incident.
